/*
  TourLauncher.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 misc surface · 0001 · TourLauncher (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  TourLauncher resolves (table "TourLauncher") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact keys extracted from the web source
  (features/onboarding/TourLauncher.tsx). The second group is the per-tour
  title/description pairs from the registry (lib/tourRegistry.ts + the eight
  features/onboarding/tours/*.ts definitions). The remainder backs the native
  state envelope (loading, empty, error retry, freshness chip, connectivity
  banner) and the header close affordance.
*/

